OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMainly dry
OL,6,Fwith clear spells most widespread in
OL,7,Fthe east, but a few scattered light
OL,8,Fshowers appearing across Dumfries and
OL,9,FGalloway. Southwest winds freshening
OL,10,Fovernight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FMost staying dry with best
OL,13,Fof the brighter spells appearing
OL,14,Fthrough the morning and towards the
OL,15,Feast coast. Isolated showers over
OL,16,FDumfries and Galloway, building late
OL,17,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
