OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FIsolated
OL,6,Fshowers Sunday morning, then periods
OL,7,Fof rain for afternoon. Most dry and
OL,8,Foccasionally bright on Monday. Tuesday
OL,9,Fturning wet and windy.
